  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "suzhou-apartment",
    "name": "苏州夏日傍晚公寓",
    "description": {
      "zh": "三室两厅一阳台（12×9m，坐标单位=米，x右/y下），苏州 7 月傍晚基线（31.5°C / 68%RH / 550ppm CO2）。感知员无执行器，必须通过 AC 协作让气候/空气/照明/家电 Agent 行动。事件：日落西晒、厨房油烟、书房 CO2、主卧沐浴湿气、次卧升温。内嵌 2 条确定性业务 Flow：厨房烟雾超标自动开油烟机排风、每天 17:00 客厅空调预冷到 26°C——触发即执行，不经过 LLM，与 Agent 协作决策并存。（v2.1 刷新：节点全部对齐引擎可执行命令面，内嵌 2 条确定性 Flow）",
      "en": "A 3-bedroom apartment (12×9m, units=meters, x right / y down) on a Suzhou July evening (31.5°C / 68%RH / 550ppm CO2 baseline). The sensing agent has no actuators — it must collaborate through AC to make the climate / air / lighting / appliance agents act. Events: sunset west-sun heat, kitchen smoke, study CO2, master-bath humidity, second-bedroom heat. Two deterministic flows are embedded: auto range-hood exhaust when kitchen smoke runs high, and a daily 17:00 living-room pre-cool to 26°C — fired deterministically, no LLM in the loop, coexisting with agent collaboration. (v2.1 refresh: node capabilities aligned to the engine command surface; 2 embedded deterministic flows)"
    },
    "tagline": {
      "zh": "西晒、油烟、闷热、潮湿——苏州夏夜一间公寓，感知员与四个执行管家的协作日常",
      "en": "West sun, kitchen smoke, stuffiness, steam — one Suzhou summer-evening apartment, one sensor and four acting stewards."
    },
    "heroEventId": "evt-kitchen-smoke",
    "recommendedPlaybackRate": 5,
    "vendorDisclaimer": {
      "zh": "场景中出现的品牌名称（小米/米家、格力、飞利浦、Aqara、霍尼韦尔、Yeelight、青萍、明基）仅作 illustrative 演示用途，不代表任何商业背书、授权或合作关系。",
      "en": "Brand names appearing in this scenario (Xiaomi/Mi Home, Gree, Philips, Aqara, Honeywell, Yeelight, Qingping, BenQ) are used for illustrative demo purposes only and do not represent any commercial endorsement, authorization, or partnership."
    }
  },
